OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sat 31 Oct to Mon 9 Nov
OL,6,FPressure is set to build in the
OL,7,Fvicinity of the UK as we move into
OL,8,Fearly November, with a lot of dry
OL,9,Fweather as a result. Before this
OL,10,Foccurs, a weather front bringing some
OL,11,Frain will be in place across some
OL,12,Fwestern and northern areas at the very
OL,13,Fstart of this period, but is likely to
OL,14,Fweaken quickly as high pressure takes
OL,15,Fcharge. Within the high pressure, some
OL,16,Fplaces, perhaps more likely towards
OL,17,Fthe east, will likely see overnight
OL,18,Fand morning fog, which at this time of
OL,19,Fyear could take a while to clear and
OL,20,Fwhere it lingers, it will remain
OL,21,Fchilly. Otherwise, temperatures
OL,22,Fgenerally fairly close to average for
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Fmost during this period.
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,164,160,301,260,100,100
