OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tue 10 Nov to Tue 24 Nov
OL,6,FProbably largely settled at first,
OL,7,Fperhaps with some chilly nights.
OL,8,FMoving further into November, there is
OL,9,Fan increased chance of more unsettled
OL,10,Fconditions developing, with a return
OL,11,Fto spells of rain and potential for
OL,12,Fstrong winds. However, the extent and
OL,13,Flocation of wettest or windiest areas
OL,14,Fis uncertain. Overall, temperatures
OL,15,Fwill probably be near or a little
OL,16,Fabove average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
